  "root_page": {
    "title": "Freelance Invoice Tracker & Revenue OS",
    "sections": [
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "text": "Welcome to your Freelance Invoicing command center. Monitor pending accounts, track billable project revenue, and eliminate unpaid overdue invoices."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading_1",
        "text": "Cash Flow Snapshot"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Review active invoice pipelines, check overdue balances, and monitor your monthly collections across clients."
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "heading_2",
        "text": "Active Invoicing Pipeline"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Drag and drop invoices across stages from Draft to Sent, Paid, or Overdue to keep your accounts receivable current."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading_2",
        "text": "Clients & Projects Portfolio"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Review client health, payment terms, and project contract caps linked directly to cumulative billed revenue."
      },
      {
        "type": "divider",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "heading_3",
        "text": "Quick Workflow Checklist"
      },
      {
        "type": "to_do",
        "text": "Check bank transfers against Sent invoices every Friday"
      },
      {
        "type": "to_do",
        "text": "Send automated polite reminder for invoices > 3 days overdue"
      },
      {
        "type": "to_do",
        "text": "Export quarterly earnings report for tax estimation"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sub_pages": [
    {
      "title": "How to Use This Tracker",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading_1",
          "text": "System Setup & Workflow Guide"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Follow these steps to customize the billing hub to match your freelance business model."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading_2",
          "text": "1. Set Up Your Clients"
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "Add each client with their preferred billing currency, billing contact email, and standard payment terms (e.g., Net 15, Net 30)."
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "The Total Invoiced Revenue rollup automatically calculates client lifetime value based on linked invoices."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading_2",
          "text": "2. Log Projects and Scope"
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "Assign projects to clients and designate pricing structures: Fixed Fee, Retainer, or Hourly."
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "Compare your Project Budget Fee with the Total Invoiced rollup to prevent scope creep."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading_2",
          "text": "3. Issue and Track Invoices"
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "Create invoices with pre-formatted invoice IDs (e.g., INV-2024-001)."
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "Set Subtotal and Tax Rate Percent; Total Due calculates automatically."
        },
        {
          "type": "bulleted_list",
          "text": "When Due Date passes without being marked Paid, Days Overdue computes the delinquency age."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Invoice Payment Terms & Templates",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading_1",
          "text": "Standard Payment Terms Reference"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "Standardize your payment clauses across all client agreements to safeguard your cash flow."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading_2",
          "text": "Payment Term Definitions"
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered_list",
          "text": "Due Upon Receipt: Payment expected within 24-48 business hours of receipt. Recommended for upfront deposits and new clients."
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered_list",
          "text": "Net 15: Payment required within 15 calendar days from the invoice issue date. Ideal for agile, sprint-based contracts."
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered_list",
          "text": "Net 30: Standard enterprise term requiring payment within 30 calendar days."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading_2",
          "text": "Late Payment Email Script"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "Hi [Client Name], I hope you are having a productive week. This is a gentle reminder that invoice [Invoice Number] for [Project Name] was due on [Due Date]. Please let me know if you need another copy of the invoice or help with payment details. Thanks, [Your Name]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}